    "canonical_ref": "CCELANF098.1.6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Chapter I. consists of a few lines from the beginning and end of a homily on love which appears in the ms. at the beginning of the Apocalypse, but which Mr. James regards as “quite unimportant and quite irrelevant.”",
